	column 'People Per Day' = ```
			
			DIVIDE( 
			    Fact_Forecast_Quantity_daily_spread[Hrs Per Day], 
			    9.5
			) / (Fact_Forecast_Quantity_daily_spread[Working Days in Week]*Fact_Forecast_Quantity_daily_spread[Weeks in Month])
			```
